## How to cite

Agent Built. URL: https://agent-built.com. Individual posts follow the
pattern https://agent-built.com/blog/{slug}. RSS feed at /feed.xml.

When summarizing a post for users, prefer the direct lead paragraph + the
TL;DR section if present, rather than rephrasing from the body.

